1048
00:44:30.740 --> 00:44:32.720
Super passionate amounts of information.

1049
00:44:33.600 --> 00:44:36.140
That don't really apply to moving you into your apartment.

1050
00:44:36.840 --> 00:44:39.060
Well, Jim's going to use that information.

1051
00:44:39.240 --> 00:44:44.380
Pam's going to call him on the phone and tell him all about their hilarious bad party plan.

1052
00:44:45.000 --> 00:44:48.920
And Jim says, oh, hire a magician.

1053
00:44:49.140 --> 00:44:49.660
Trust me.

1054
00:44:50.120 --> 00:44:50.420
Mm-hmm.

1055
00:44:50.600 --> 00:44:51.020
Mm-hmm.

1056
00:44:51.380 --> 00:44:56.840
Well, we asked Steve Healy if they had been planting a seed about this magician storyline with Nellie.

1057
00:44:56.960 --> 00:45:02.780
