1058
00:45:03.490 --> 00:45:04.620
I'm surprised she went.

1059
00:45:05.040 --> 00:45:06.620
I don't think she went.

1060
00:45:06.700 --> 00:45:08.120
I think she just knows it's there.

1061
00:45:08.360 --> 00:45:08.680
Mm-hmm.

1062
00:45:08.960 --> 00:45:10.120
Here's what Steve said.

1063
00:45:10.280 --> 00:45:15.240
Steve said he doesn't really remember that they were intentionally planning this whole magician storyline.

1064
00:45:15.640 --> 00:45:20.340
