1180
00:49:58.280 --> 00:50:01.480
But if you go to the website, they have a lot of rugged terrain.

1181
00:50:02.300 --> 00:50:08.100
So, you know, the shot of people, like, driving off-road to set up camp at a creek?

1182
00:50:08.280 --> 00:50:08.540
Yeah.

1183
00:50:08.760 --> 00:50:09.480
Canyon Ranch.

1184
00:50:09.640 --> 00:50:10.080
Got it.

1185
00:50:10.420 --> 00:50:10.640
Yeah.

1186
00:50:10.760 --> 00:50:12.260
I saw a lot of those on the website.

1187
00:50:12.260 --> 00:50:15.160
I didn't see any horror movies, but I'm sure.

1188
00:50:15.420 --> 00:50:15.800
Right?

1189
00:50:16.140 --> 00:50:18.440
I wonder if Cabin in the Woods was shot there.

1190
00:50:18.880 --> 00:50:19.760
We'll never know.

1191
00:50:19.800 --> 00:50:20.480
We'll never know.

1192
00:50:20.660 --> 00:50:21.880
Mom Detective moment.

1193
00:50:22.020 --> 00:50:22.640
We'll never know.

