00:50:23.180 --> 00:50:28.080
Well, Steve Healy said that the cabin they filmed at had some really kooky angles.

1195
00:50:28.340 --> 00:50:28.740
Oh, yeah.

1196
00:50:28.920 --> 00:50:31.360
And it was very challenging to get some of the shots.

1197
00:50:31.560 --> 00:50:35.680
He also said that he didn't think the Santa Monica Mountains looked much like Pennsylvania,

