Hey, the Alaskan king is the biggest bed.

1254
00:53:11.800 --> 00:53:14.600
It is nine feet by nine feet.

1255
00:53:14.900 --> 00:53:17.960
It runs anywhere from $3,500 to $10,000.

1256
00:53:18.500 --> 00:53:21.420
I found a website called alaskankingbeds.com.

1257
00:53:21.720 --> 00:53:25.480
They sell these beds, bed frames, and sheets, and bedding.

1258
00:53:25.480 --> 00:53:34.460
In the photo, there is a family of six and their full-size golden retriever dog all sitting on this bed with plenty of room to spare.

1259
00:53:34.640 --> 00:53:35.980
It looks like a small swimming pool.

1260
00:53:36.280 --> 00:53:37.400
It's so big.

1261
00:53:37.520 --> 00:53:39.360
But what size of room is it in?

1262
00:53:39.500 --> 00:53:40.980
That's the problem, right?

1263
00:53:41.120 --> 00:53:41.440
Yeah.

1264
00:53:41.820 --> 00:53:42.880
Big room, I guess.

1265
00:53:42.880 --> 00:53:49.840
I mean, I guess if I'm a professional basketball player, I got a sweet pad, and I need a lot of legroom.

1266
00:53:50.180 --> 00:53:50.380
Yeah.

1267
00:53:50.880 --> 00:53:51.660
I mean.

1268
00:53:52.040 --> 00:53:53.580
Remember those shows?

1269
00:53:53.580 --> 00:53:57.540
Was it on MTV where it was like you went and got to see people's houses?

1270
00:53:57.540 --> 00:53:59.340
Was it called like Cribs or something?

1271
00:53:59.540 --> 00:53:59.740
Yeah.

